{"articleNo":"62484","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=62484&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"구미지역 통학버스 운행시간(학기중) 조정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.08.24","hit":"6122","attachments":[{"name":"구미지역셔틀버스(2012. 9. 3.).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=62484&attachNo=70648"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012학년도 2학기 개강에 따라 구미지역 통학버스 운행시간(학기중)을 붙임과 같이 조정</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">하여 통보하오니 이용에 착오 없으시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 시행기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><u>2012. 9. 3.(월)부터 </u></strong>추후 운행시간 조정시 까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;단, 공휴일 및 휴무일 제외</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 조정사유 : 개학으로 인한 승차 인원 증가</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 조정내용 : 구미지역 3행선지 6회 ⇒ 4행선지 11회 증편 운행</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 하교시 학교 출발장소 : 다목적운동장 뒤편 버스주차장(공실관 서편) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;붙임&nbsp; 구미지역 통학버스 운행노선 및 시간표&nbsp; 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
